; MITEMSHUB AI v22.0 — Volatility 100 (tiny-account active profile, VALIDATED)
; Regenerated 2026-08-25 with FULL v22 input coverage (v15-era keys dropped).
; Magic standardized 2026-08-25 for 5-symbol parallel operation: 7788100.
;
; Edge allocation per walk-forward research:
;   PRIMARY  : Band fade  z>=2.0, stop=0.10x sigma_h, target=0.80x sigma_h (R_100 optimized)
;   SUPPORT  : Mean reversion (ranging) + EMA pullback (trend)
;   CONFLUENCE ONLY : Momentum candle (can NEVER trigger an entry alone)
;   DISABLED : Breakout (unvalidated on synthetics — chase risk)
;
; TINY-ACCOUNT MODE ($30): min lot forces ~25% effective risk/trade.
; InpMaxEffectiveRiskPct caps catastrophe; DailyLoss 0.30 ~= 1 losing trade.
; REAL FIX = fund account to $250+ or drop symbol risk; see PRODUCTION_CONFIGS.md.
;
InpUsePullback=true
InpUseBreakout=false
